5,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want this trip to be a huge adventure! I'll look into the ferry sailings and train time, and also how last year's days ran to see what we did!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll keep things practical. I'm going to look into getting around by train and bus, as well as the ferry sailings and train time. Let's see if we can actually make this efficient.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to ensure the financial side is transparent. I'll look into the all-in rates against meals bought separately and the pricing of offshore houses let whole.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'll check the bathing hours and bathroom provision, and the inn mealtimes and room arrangements. I want to make sure the actual living situation is handled properly this time.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll look into the time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran. I want to understand the balance of our time together.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
